{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Cleaners</strong> is a cooperative game for up to 4 cleaners, where your job is to clean various treasure chambers left in disarray by the <span class=\"bb_strike\">exploded</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">crushed</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">disassembled</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">half-digested</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">broken</span> remains of heroic knights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/368b3bb4d2530871fb4671845ad348ed.avif?t=1767789904\" width=846 height=123 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no time to slack off or light up a cigarette! The floor must be cleaned as quickly as possible. There\u2019s no proof the dungeon is actually monster-free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/cd3d529258c52d4509b403473f2c63bd.poster.avif?t=1767789904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/cd3d529258c52d4509b403473f2c63bd.webm?t=1767789904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/cd3d529258c52d4509b403473f2c63bd.mp4?t=1767789904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/ea72b8f5345d2c83b89ce7856f568071.avif?t=1767789904\" width=653 height=121 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in the Middle Ages, you can find traces of cryptocurrency. Work hard or resell items left behind by fallen knights to stack up Stable Coins and invest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/eb3769f972884bf385c54a18b2b25de9.poster.avif?t=1767789904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/eb3769f972884bf385c54a18b2b25de9.webm?t=1767789904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/eb3769f972884bf385c54a18b2b25de9.mp4?t=1767789904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/1c62827e1c1ac8ffc4b6e09f4fbff72a.avif?t=1767789904\" width=664 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning a dungeon isn\u2019t just about mopping the floor. Danger still lurks, not all traps have been disarmed, and nothing guarantees the monsters are truly gone. Stay alert, work as a team, and know when to retreat at the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/300e4b3ae51b2befe6b47d0fb2090363.poster.avif?t=1767789904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/300e4b3ae51b2befe6b47d0fb2090363.webm?t=1767789904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/300e4b3ae51b2befe6b47d0fb2090363.mp4?t=1767789904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/e15140334051c650501c20b009804837.avif?t=1767789904\" width=731 height=137 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it\u2019s in the shop, it\u2019s not even cheating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/37f4468c12f0b3768cfd5675de6fd912.poster.avif?t=1767789904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/37f4468c12f0b3768cfd5675de6fd912.webm?t=1767789904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/extras/37f4468c12f0b3768cfd5675de6fd912.mp4?t=1767789904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756600?t=1767789904","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/1bd96aefb0fe5628423982c472869c3a44b009d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767789904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/4991b81ffc353c3c4729c7e125907aaef319b039/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767789904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756600/4991b81ffc353c3c4729c7e125907aaef319b039/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767789904","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Cleaners</strong> is a cooperative game for up to 4 cleaners, where your job is to clean various treasure chambers left in disarray by the <span class=\"bb_strike\">exploded</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">crushed</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">disassembled</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">half-digested</span>, <span class=\"bb_